orps VR","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Anticorps VR - $0.99 USD","packageid":371725,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":99}],"title":"Buy Anticorps VR"}],"packages":[371725],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-4590 / AMD FX 8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 / AMD RX580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","discount_percent":0,"final":99,"final_formatted":"$0.99 USD","initial":99,"initial_formatted":""},"publishers":["Development Unreal Creative"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"rating":"l"},"igrs":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Kekerasan","rating":"13","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"13","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"30 Jul, 2019"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cRemember that movie Osmosis Jones?  If you wanted to play that game in VR, then Anticorps is exactly what you need. Set inside infected patients\u2019 bodies, you must destroy pathogens as you protect an antibody developing inside. The game mixes strategy with action, and there are 23 different enemies to battle as well as a giant boss. Nine game modes are currently offered at launch.  Fitness Potential Anticorps blends slower strategy gameplay with direct combat. You have access to a hammer weapon for beating up enemies that draw near. The hammer is also used for deflecting projectiles that are thrown your way by the virus. For tougher encounters, a wand device can spray out a healing mist. We hope our immune systems aren\u2019t actually this violent in real life.\u201d<br>VR Fitness Insider<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_4a9763599ff364bb376781a6585cca78650dab78.1920x1080.jpg?t=1707311549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_4a9763599ff364bb376781a6585cca78650dab78.600x338.jpg?t=1707311549"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_1378625362bdf78a435e39bb814b015bc668d475.1920x1080.jpg?t=1707311549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_1378625362bdf78a435e39bb814b015bc668d475.600x338.jpg?t=1707311549"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_653e063361770b7b3986fd7413a1b988b1b28de5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1707311549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_653e063361770b7b3986fd7413a1b988b1b28de5.600x338.jpg?t=1707311549"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_6755d4aeaaafa8ed8ad648c9f0bb1ee4075dd543.1920x1080.jpg?t=1707311549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_6755d4aeaaafa8ed8ad648c9f0bb1ee4075dd543.600x338.jpg?t=1707311549"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_a3fdff150f913abe51c9ae1b14c379d0cfa1c9b9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1707311549","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1101220/ss_a3fdff150f913abe51c9ae1b14c379d0cfa1c9b9.600x338.jpg?t=1707311549"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.aka